\author{brentyorgey}
\meta{venue}{New York Haskell Users' Group}
\meta{video}{https://vimeo.com/84104226}
\meta{video}{https://vimeo.com/84249042}
\meta{slides}{\pub{13-11-25-nyhaskell-diagrams.pdf}}

\p{Over the past ten years, I have solved over 1700 competitive programming problems in Haskell, just for fun (as well as a few that were not fun). I will give a brief introduction to competitive programming and show off some examples demonstrating the unique benefits of Haskell in this context. We will then have a miniature programming contest, open to all—only Haskell allowed!}
